t of managing leads, from direct inquiries to MLS agency referrals. </p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-18c0626 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"18c0626\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1cdeae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f1cdeae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:117\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> fuels your sales pipeline with a powerful lead generation system:</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:114\"><strong>All captured leads are automatically converted into contacts, ready to be added to your <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/sales-pipeline-tracking/how-to-use-pipeline/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pipeline</a>.</strong></p>\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-7:0\">\n<li data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:103\"><strong>MLS LEADS:</strong> Connect with qualified clients referred by fellow agents on the MLS platform.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"6:1-7:0\"><strong>MICROSITE LEADS:</strong> Capture enquiries from direct potential clients through your <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/microsite-share-properties-listings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Branded MicroSite.</a></li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"6:1-7:0\"><b>PORTAL LEADS:</b> <a href=\"http://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> public property portal generates qualified direct leads right to you!<br /><br />\n<p><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"><b>No matter where they come from, all your leads are conveniently collected in one place for easy management, follow-up and overview.</b></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:123\">This comprehensive approach ensures a steady stream of leads being managed easily, allowing you to focus on converting them into happy clients.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:123\">Happy Hunting!</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:123\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-10180 size-full\" src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive.jpg\" alt=\"PropertyList\" width=\"1734\" height=\"671\" srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive.jpg 1734w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-300x116.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1024x396.jpg 1024w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-768x297.jpg 768w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-20x8.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-32x12.jpg 32w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1536x594.jpg 1536w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-600x232.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1734px) 100vw, 1734px\" /></a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"details_cont ent recently_added\" id=\"content_elements\"><h4 class=\"c_head\">Articles</h4><ul class=\"article_list\"><li class=\"page_item page-item-10240\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/mls-leads/\">MLS Leads (from other agents)</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10241\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/direct-microsite-leads/\">MicroSite Leads (Direct)</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10414\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/portal-leads/\">Portal Leads (Direct)</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10281\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/convert-a-lead-into-a-contact/\">Convert a lead into a contact</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10228 page_item_has_children\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/how-propertylist-generates-direct-leads-for-you/\">How PropertyList generates direct leads for you?</a>\n<ul class='children'>\n\t<li class=\"page_item page-item-10234\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/how-propertylist-generates-direct-leads-for-you/understanding-the-propertylist-lead-generation-model/\">Understanding the PropertyList lead generation model</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"page_item page-item-10235\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/how-propertylist-generates-direct-leads-for-you/optimising-your-listings-for-maximum-lead-generation/\">Optimising your listings for maximum lead generation</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div>\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/mls-property-alerts/\">\r\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tMLS Property Alerts                </a>\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\